consume: "GCO06--07 / acquire same identity\nMatch RequestId / ABI / current grant authority\nThen wrapper branch and owner reload\nResponse delivery differs from allocation / credit use" {class: proposed}
outcome -> consume
credit: "GCM03--08 / still credit authority\nReserved -> Allocating -> actual committed or known refund\nOne member credit d_j, not batch D per caller\nOutstanding credits survive recount / lost response" {class: proposed}
