unknown: "No guessed failure mapping\nPartial preparation / moving state retains VM / roots\nUnknown is not false-success or safe overflow\nNo finite recovery / retention bound proved" {class: boundary}
prepare -> unknown: "missing or unknown disposition"
limits: "Still unresolved\nLeader-local result semantic repair / complete ABI consumers\nNative visibility / actual allocation / init / refund\nPhysical users / progress / net benefit" {class: boundary}
